  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre TF-40 305 18M V3 is a precision-focused control racquet designed for advanced players seeking the best balance between maneuverability and maximum directional control. It features a 98 sq.in head, 305 g unstrung weight and a dense 18x20 string pattern for exceptional consistency and reduced string movement. RS Sharp Section geometry optimizes frame flex at impact to preserve trajectory control, the polyurethane foam-filled frame improves comfort and feel, and Extense BG grommets help maintain responsiveness on off-center contact.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre TF-40 305 18M V3 是一款面向高级及比赛型球员的精准控制型球拍，在灵活操控与极致控制之间取得优秀平衡。采用98平方英寸拍面、305克空拍重量及18×20密集线床，能够提供非常稳定的击球轨迹、优秀的方向控制，并减少球线移动与断线概率。RS Sharp Section 拍框结构优化击球瞬间的拍框弯曲，以维持稳定的线路控制；整支拍框内部填充聚氨酯泡沫，提升减震表现与扎实手感；Extense BG 加宽加长线孔则帮助球线保持一定活动空间，使偏心击球仍具有良好响应。"
  },

